k you to everyone who came by~ it was really fun to walk around and talkie~ do come by on the next one•"}, {"time": 7368.205, "timestamp": "02:02:48", "author": "@MikazukiYure", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/uuFSD7qVrZy0JUWrBRfSfEKIQpib7_2xP24Yiu1ND1Mq6uhaYIHDnA5EiGz_o33FUhHYvbCT9g=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "UCdZBnUb7m8Pd_wUTDNqUu3Q/PVfsZ-7tIYCO_9EPt-GMgAw"}]